      "writtenOn": "2015-08-20T03:26:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suggest to set want_g3_exit here, too, and remove the reset of want_g3_exit at line 196. Consider a race condition: if the power button is pressed after S5 inactivity timer expires and before the state changing to POWER_S5G3, the system will not start up. You can refer to the CL:290280 for detail. To set want_g3_exit here, the system will go to G3 and then exit G3, just like what it would do in POWER_S5G3.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 283,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 283,
        "endChar": 15
      },
      "revId": "f7a0072b48d1545d1567fba3415e4ef08f9951bc",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
